{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, רְבָה","hw":"רְבָה","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">רְבָה</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. grow great (</strong>𝔗 Syriac; v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, רָבָה\" href=\"/BDB,_רָבָה\", dir=\"rtl\">I. רבה</a><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:8\" href=\"/Daniel.4.8\">Dn 4:8</a> +; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְבָת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:19\" href=\"/Daniel.4.19\">19</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְבַיְתָ</span> Kt (> <span dir=\"rtl\">רְבַת</span> Qr K<sup>§ 47, Beisp. 1) a)</sup>) v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:19\" href=\"/Daniel.4.19\">19</a>;—<em>grow tall and large</em>, of tree <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:8\" href=\"/Daniel.4.8\">Dn 4:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:17\" href=\"/Daniel.4.17\">17</a>; <em>grow long</em>, of hair v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:30\" href=\"/Daniel.4.30\">30</a>; fig. <em>grow great</em>, of king v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:19\" href=\"/Daniel.4.19\">19</a>, <em>increase</em>, of greatness v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:19\" href=\"/Daniel.4.19\">19</a>.<br><strong>Pa.</strong>  <em>make great:</em> Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">רַבִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:48\" href=\"/Daniel.2.48\">2:48</a> c. ל acc. pers.","next":"BDB Aramaic, רְבוּ","prev":"BDB Aramaic, רַבְרְבָן"}